{
  "zhTitle": "Submit",
  "summary": "Canton 参考文档：Submit。",
  "body": "<div class=\"x2mdx-ref-page x2mdx-ref-page--操作\" />\n\n<div className=\"x2mdx-ref-operation-shell\">\n  <div className=\"x2mdx-ref-operation-main\">\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-breadcrumbs\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n      <span>账本API</span>\n\n      <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-breadcrumb-separator\">›</span>\n\n      <a href=\"../../details\">gRPC API</a>\n\n      <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-breadcrumb-separator\">›</span>\n\n      <a href=\"../../com-daml-ledger-api-v2\">v2</a>\n\n      <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-breadcrumb-separator\">›</span>\n\n      <span>提交</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-hero\">\n      <p class=\"x2mdx-ref-eyebrow\">com.daml.ledger.api.v2</p>\n\n      <h1 class=\"x2mdx-ref-title\">提交</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-badges\">\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--protocol\">gRPC</span>\n\n        <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-badge x2mdx-ref-badge--linked\">自 3.4.4 起</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-operation-bar\">\n      <span class=\"x2mdx-ref-operation-method x2mdx-ref-operation-method--rpc\">RPC</span>\n\n      <code>/com.daml.ledger.api.v2.CommandSubmissionService/提交</code>\n    </div>\n\n    ## 协议详细信息\n\n    <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>协议</dt>\n        <dd>gRPC</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>服务</dt>\n        <dd>CommandSubmissionService</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>RPC</dt>\n        <dd>提交</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>客户端流</dt>\n        <dd>否</dd>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-item\">\n        <dt>服务器流</dt>\n        <dd>否</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n\n    ## 输入\n\n    <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-panel\">\n      <div class=\"x2mdx-ref-panel-head\">\n        <h3>提交请求</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <dl class=\"x2mdx-ref-meta-grid\">\n   